@startuml
[*] --> NoProfileActive
NoProfileActive --> ProfileCreated : Create Profile
ProfileCreated --> ProfileActive : Activate Profile
ProfileCreated --> ProfileManagement : Manage Profiles
ProfileActive --> InformationSaved : Save Information
ProfileActive --> InformationRetrieved : Retrieve Information
ProfileActive --> NoProfileActive : Deactivate Profile
InformationSaved --> ProfileActive : Return to Profile
InformationRetrieved --> ProfileActive : Return to Profile
ProfileManagement --> ProfileEdited : Edit Profile
ProfileManagement --> ProfileDeleted : Delete Profile
ProfileManagement --> ProfileShared : Share Profile
ProfileEdited --> ProfileManagement : Return to Management
ProfileDeleted --> ProfileManagement : Return to Management
ProfileDeleted --> NoProfileActive : No Profiles Left
ProfileShared --> ProfileManagement : Return to Management
ProfileShared --> [*] : End
NoProfileActive --> [*] : End
@enduml
